{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08973","headline":"慈恩伽蓝清会 · 韦应物","name":"慈恩伽蓝清会","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素友俱薄世，屡招清景赏。\n鸣钟悟音闻，宿昔心已往。\n重门相洞达，高宇亦遐朗。\n岚岭晓城分，清阴夏条长。\n氲氛芳台馥，萧散竹池广。\n平荷随波泛，廻飙激林响。\n蔬食遵道侣，泊怀遗滞想。\n何彼尘昏人，区区在天壤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}